  "body": "What a wonderful seaside apartment this is. Offering two bedrooms, one bathroom, spacious living, single garage with off street parking for 2 cars, plus a very large lanscaped garden ideal for that outdoor living.\r\n\r\nSituated just 100 metres from Kohimarama Beach and constructed from solid concrete block back in the 1970's this is a magic find.\r\n\r\nThe title is a leasehold crosslease, so no body corporate levy and 20 years to run  before automatic renewal of the lease.\r\n\r\nThis downstairs apartment is close to restaurants, cafes, schools, parks, bus routes, tennis club, bowls and of course,one of the very best beaches in Auckland.\r\n\r\nViewing is at the open houses each Sunday at 12.30\r\n\r\nBe quick, priced to sell.",
